# Test
*.test
*.out
coverage.html

# Session handoff notes — written by the /handoff workflow, transient by
# design and personal to whoever generated them. Twice swept into unrelated
# commits by `git add -A` before this entry existed. Use `git add -f` to
# commit one deliberately.
HANDOFF.md
HANDOFF_*.md

# Test-run reports — written by `make test*`, transient by design.
# Kept untracked so re-running locally doesn't show up as drift.
tests/reports/*.log
tests/reports/*.html
tests/reports/*.out

# Go
vendor/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Local dev
locallinks/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Binaries from `go build .` in a main-package directory. The output takes
# the directory's name and carries no extension, so `git add -A` sweeps it
# into an unrelated commit. Nine accumulated that way in mcpkit before a
# filter-repo purge took .git from 466 MB to 23 MB. scripts/check-no-binaries.sh
# is the real gate and detects by magic bytes rather than by name; these
# entries just keep the common cases out of `git status`.
surfaces/chat/chat
surfaces/chat/agentchat
surfaces/chat/bin/
surfaces/web/cmd/agentweb/agentweb
examples/agent-async/agent-async
examples/critic/critic
examples/multi-agent/multi-agent

# Node artifacts for the agentweb frontend.
node_modules/
surfaces/web/web/dist/
